<h2>Hello <%= @reservation.customer_name %>,</h2>

<p>Your reservation at <strong><%= @reservation.restaurant.name %></strong> is currently marked as:</p>

<p><strong>Status: <%= @reservation.status.capitalize %></strong></p>

<p>Reservation Date: <%= @reservation.reservation_date %></p>
<p>Time: <%= @reservation.reservation_time.strftime("%I:%M %p") %></p>

<p>Thank you!</p>
